    "By the contributors of Tatoeba, used under CC BY 2.0 FR. Changed for typing: romanized and split into chunks for Japanese and Chinese (Chinese converted to Simplified), and paired with the 2-Set keys for Korean.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Von den Mitwirkenden bei Tatoeba, verwendet unter CC BY 2.0 FR. Zum Tippen angepasst: Für Japanisch und Chinesisch romanisiert und in Abschnitte geteilt (Chinesisch in Kurzzeichen umgewandelt), für Koreanisch mit den 2-Set-Tasten verknüpft."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By the contributors of Tatoeba, used under CC BY 2.0 FR. Changed for typing: romanized and split into chunks for Japanese and Chinese (Chinese converted to Simplified), and paired with the 2-Set keys for Korean."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Por los colaboradores de Tatoeba, con licencia CC BY 2.0 FR. Adaptado para escribir: romanizado y dividido en fragmentos para el japonés y el chino (chino convertido a simplificado), y emparejado con las teclas 2-Set para el coreano."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Par les contributeurs de Tatoeba, sous licence CC BY 2.0 FR. Adapté pour la frappe : romanisé et découpé en segments pour le japonais et le chinois (chinois converti en simplifié), et associé aux touches 2-Set pour le coréen."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dai contributori di Tatoeba, usate con licenza CC BY 2.0 FR. Modificate per la digitazione: traslitterate e divise in blocchi per giapponese e cinese (cinese convertito in semplificato) e abbinate ai tasti 2-Set per il coreano."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tatoebaの投稿者による文で、CC BY 2.0 FRのもとで使用しています。タイピング用に変更しています。日本語と中国語はローマ字化して区切り（中国語は簡体字に変換）、韓国語は2ボル式のキーと対応付けています。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tatoeba 기여자들의 문장으로, CC BY 2.0 FR에 따라 사용합니다. 타자 연습용으로 수정했습니다. 일본어와 중국어는 로마자로 바꾸어 나누었고(중국어는 간체로 변환), 한국어는 두벌식 키와 짝지었습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Door de bijdragers van Tatoeba, gebruikt onder CC BY 2.0 FR. Aangepast om te typen: geromaniseerd en in stukken verdeeld voor Japans en Chinees (Chinees omgezet naar vereenvoudigd), en gekoppeld aan de 2-Set-toetsen voor Koreaans."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pelos colaboradores do Tatoeba, usadas sob CC BY 2.0 FR. Alteradas para digitação: romanizadas e divididas em partes para japonês e chinês (chinês convertido para simplificado) e associadas às teclas 2-Set para coreano."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由 Tatoeba 贡献者提供，按 CC BY 2.0 FR 使用。为打字做了修改：日文和中文已转为罗马字或拼音并分段（中文转为简体），韩文配上了两套式按键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
