    "Words and sentences come from public-domain books on Project Gutenberg, and Japanese, Chinese and Korean sentences from Tatoeba contributors (CC BY 2.0 FR).": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wörter und Sätze stammen aus gemeinfreien Büchern von Project Gutenberg, japanische, chinesische und koreanische Sätze von Mitwirkenden bei Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Words and sentences come from public-domain books on Project Gutenberg, and Japanese, Chinese and Korean sentences from Tatoeba contributors (CC BY 2.0 FR)."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las palabras y frases proceden de libros de dominio público de Project Gutenberg, y las frases en japonés, chino y coreano, de colaboradores de Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mots et les phrases viennent de livres du domaine public sur Project Gutenberg, et les phrases en japonais, chinois et coréen de contributeurs de Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le parole e le frasi provengono da libri di pubblico dominio su Project Gutenberg, e le frasi in giapponese, cinese e coreano dai contributori di Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "単語と文はProject Gutenbergのパブリックドメインの本から、日本語、中国語、韓国語の文はTatoebaの投稿者（CC BY 2.0 FR）から提供されています。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "단어와 문장은 Project Gutenberg의 퍼블릭 도메인 책에서, 일본어, 중국어, 한국어 문장은 Tatoeba 기여자들(CC BY 2.0 FR)에게서 가져왔습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Woorden en zinnen komen uit boeken in het publieke domein op Project Gutenberg, en Japanse, Chinese en Koreaanse zinnen van bijdragers aan Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As palavras e frases vêm de livros em domínio público no Project Gutenberg, e as frases em japonês, chinês e coreano vêm de colaboradores do Tatoeba (CC BY 2.0 FR)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单词和句子来自 Project Gutenberg 上的公有领域书籍，日文、中文和韩文句子来自 Tatoeba 贡献者（CC BY 2.0 FR）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words are grouped into short sentences with capitals and commas, periods and question marks. When a character needs Shift, the Shift keys are outlined.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wörter werden zu kurzen Sätzen mit Großbuchstaben, Kommas, Punkten und Fragezeichen gruppiert. Braucht ein Zeichen die Umschalttaste, werden die Umschalttasten umrandet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Words are grouped into short sentences with capitals and commas, periods and question marks. When a character needs Shift, the Shift keys are outlined."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las palabras se agrupan en frases cortas con mayúsculas, comas, puntos y signos de interrogación. Cuando un carácter necesita Mayúsculas, las teclas Mayúsculas aparecen con contorno."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les mots sont regroupés en phrases courtes avec majuscules, virgules, points et points d’interrogation. Quand un caractère demande Maj, les touches Maj sont entourées."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le parole sono raggruppate in brevi frasi con maiuscole, virgole, punti e punti interrogativi. Quando un carattere richiede Maiuscole, i tasti Maiuscole sono evidenziati."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "単語を短い文にまとめ、大文字やカンマ、ピリオド、疑問符を加えます。Shiftキーが必要な文字では、Shiftキーが枠で示されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "단어를 대문자와 쉼표, 마침표, 물음표가 들어간 짧은 문장으로 묶습니다. Shift 키가 필요한 문자에서는 Shift 키에 테두리가 표시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Woorden worden gegroepeerd in korte zinnen met hoofdletters, komma's, punten en vraagtekens. Als een teken Shift nodig heeft, worden de Shift-toetsen omlijnd."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As palavras são agrupadas em frases curtas com maiúsculas, vírgulas, pontos finais e pontos de interrogação. Quando um caractere precisa de Shift, as teclas Shift ficam contornadas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单词会组成带大写字母以及逗号、句号和问号的短句。需要 Shift 键的字符，会描边显示 Shift 键。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
